  "Re-read 2026-11-16 (#647): both tables now say 'Last updated: September 18, 2026' and add Ekko, Recurrent and Stacked Deck to Cards; those two carry since 2026-09-18. The entries that were on the July 16 tables carry an explicit since 2026-07-16 so raising lastUpdated does not move their date.",
  "Radiance Ban List Updates (announced 2026-11-13, 'Effective: November 23, 2026'): 'Eight cards and two battlefields are being added to the Standard and 2v2 Constructed ban list:'. Those ten carry since 2026-11-23, and CardIndex holds an entry back until its since date. The announcement adds that these bans 'will not affect competitive events in Korea and Traditional Chinese regions until Radiance is released in those regions'; this file models the global circuit only.",
